# FinDeependence — SME Screener
**By CA Deep Dalal · Freedom with Finance**

A members-only web app that screens **every NSE Emerge + BSE SME company** on 41 fundamental
parameters. Same build style as your IPO Tracker: one HTML file, works on Android/iPhone and
Windows desktop, free to host, free data, auto-updating.

