The app ships with **clearly-labelled sample data** so you can try every feature immediately. A yellow
banner reminds you it's demo data until the first real run.

### What's in the app right now

**146 real listed SME companies with real exchange figures** — no invented names, no invented numbers.
Captured 28 Jul 2026 and kept in `data/seed/` so every figure is auditable:

| What | How many | Source |
